  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:302px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Monster-_Whisker_Blademaster.png\" title=\"Whisker Blademaster\"><img alt=\"Whisker Blademaster\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"272\" src=\"/images/recovered/Monster-_Whisker_Blademaster.png\" width=\"300\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/recovered/Monster-_Whisker_Blademaster.png\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Whisker Blademaster</div></div></div>\n<p>Whisker Blademasters are tall Whiskers who wield two swords. They charge into combat usually <a href=\"/wiki/Stunning\" title=\"Stunning\">Stunning</a> or knocking their opponent down.\n</p><p><b>Race:</b> <a href=\"/wiki/Category/Whiskers\" title=\"Category:Whiskers\">Whisker</a>\n</p><p><b>Class:</b> Melee \n</p>\n<a name=\"Basic_Types\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Basic Types</span></h2>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name\n</th><th>Element\n</th><th>Habitat\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td> Whisker Blademaster\n</td><td> None\n</td><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Dew_Valley\" title=\"Dew Valley\">Dew Valley Forest</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Algernon\" title=\"Algernon\">Algernon</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td> Poison Blademaster\n</td><td> Poison\n</td><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Algernon\" title=\"Algernon\">Algernon</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fizz Star-Soaked Blademaster\n</td><td>Poison\n</td><td>Squeakeasys off of <a href=\"/wiki/Algernon\" title=\"Algernon\">Algernon</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td> Toxic Blademaster\n</td><td> Poison\n</td><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Cavernous_Cavern_of_Caves\" title=\"Cavernous Cavern of Caves\">Cavernous Cavern of Caves</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td> Fire Dancer\n</td><td> Fire\n</td><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Cavernous_Cavern_of_Caves\" title=\"Cavernous Cavern of Caves\">Cavernous Cavern of Caves</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"The Shadow's Embrace\">Fade Library</a> off of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"The Shadow's Embrace\">The Shadow's Embrace</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td> Forest Blademaster\n</td><td> Poison\n</td><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Widower's_Nest\" title=\"Widower's Nest\">Widower's Nest</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td> Divine Whisker Blademaster\n</td><td> Divine\n</td><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Karnage's_Lot\" title=\"Karnage's Lot\">Karnage's Lot</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Frump's_Misfortune\" title=\"Frump's Misfortune\">Choppe's Shoppe</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td> Ivory Blademaster\n</td><td> Divine\n</td><td> <a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"The Shadow's Embrace\">Shadow Library</a> off of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"The Shadow's Embrace\">The Shadow's Embrace</a> L5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td> Arctic Blademaster\n</td><td> Ice\n</td><td> <a href=\"/wiki/Ratsputin's_Gulag\" title=\"Ratsputin's Gulag\">Ratsputin's Gulag</a>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<a name=\"Uniques\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Uniques</span></h2>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Rattle_Tooth\" title=\"Rattle Tooth\">Rattle Tooth</a> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Champion\" title=\"Champion\">Champion</a> who shares <a href=\"/wiki/Sissirat\" title=\"Sissirat\">Sissirat</a>'s Lair.\n</li><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Category/Rattle_Tooth's_Relatives\" title=\"Category:Rattle Tooth's Relatives\">Rattle Tooth's Relatives</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Rattle_Tooth's_Family_Friends\" title=\"Rattle Tooth's Family Friends\">Rattle Tooth's Family Friends</a> occupy higher level dungeons.  They get progressively stronger as the dungeon level gets higher.\n</li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Dr._Richard_Choppe\" title=\"Dr. Richard Choppe\">Dr. Richard Choppe</a> is a Divine Whisker Blademaster Hero who will be found in <a href=\"/wiki/Frump's_Misfortune\" title=\"Frump's Misfortune\">Choppe's Shoppe</a> off of Level 7 of <a href=\"/wiki/Frump's_Misfortune\" title=\"Frump's Misfortune\">Frump's Misfortune</a>.\n</li></ul>\n<a name=\"Behavior\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Behavior</span></h2>\n<ul><li> Whisker Blademasters have a variety of moves at their disposal, which are:\n<ul><li>A holy roller-like attack which can knock you down for 2-5 seconds\n</li><li>A butcher-like attack which deals vicious damage to low levels\n</li><li>And their normal attack, a sweeping blow with their scimitars.\n</li></ul>\n</li></ul>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
}
